|1  <br>2  <br>3  <br>4  <br>5  <br>6  <br>7  <br>8  <br>9  <br>10  <br>11  <br>12  <br>13  <br>14  <br>15  <br>16  <br>17  <br>18  <br>19  <br>20  <br>21  <br>22  <br>23  <br>24  <br>25  <br>26  <br>27  <br>28  <br>29  <br>30  <br>31  <br>32  <br>33  <br>34  <br>35  <br>36  <br>37  <br>38  <br>39  <br>40  <br>41|**public static void** main**(**String**[]** args**) {**  <br>File file **=** **new** File**(**"D:**\\**aaa**\\**src"**);**  <br>HashMap**\<**String**,** Integer**\>** hm **=** getCount**(**file**);**  <br>System**.**out**.**println**(**hm**);**  <br>  <br>**}**<br><br>  <br><br>**public static** HashMap**\<**String**,** Integer**\>** getCount**(**File src**) {**  <br>HashMap**\<**String**,** Integer**\>** hm **=** **new** HashMap**\<\>();**  <br>File**[]** files **=** src**.**listFiles**();**  <br>**for** **(**File file **:** files**) {**  <br>**if** **(**isFile**()) {**  <br>String**[]** arr **=** file**.**getName**().**split**(**"**\\**."**);**  <br>**if** **(**arr**.**length **\>=** **2****) {**  <br>String endName **=** arr**[**arr**.**length **-** **1****];**  <br>**if** **(**hm**.**containsKey**(**endName**)) {**  <br>**int** count **=** hm**.**get**(**endName**);**  <br>count**++;**  <br>hm**.**put**(**endName**,** count**);**  <br>**}** **else** **{**  <br>hm**.**put**(**endName**,** **1****);**  <br>**}**  <br>**}**  <br>**}** **else** **{**  <br>Hashmap**\<**String**,** Integer**\>** sonMap **=** getCount**(**file**);**  <br>Set**\<**Map**.**Entry**\<**String**,** Integer**\>\>** entries **=** sonMap**.**entrySet**();**  <br>**for** **(**Map**.**Entry**\<**String**,** Integer**\>** entry **:** entries**) {**  <br>String key **=** entry**.**getKey**();**  <br>**int** value **=** entry**.**getValue**();**  <br>**if** **(**hm**.**containsKey**(**key**)) {**  <br>**int** count **=** hm**.**get**(**key**);**  <br>count **=** count **+** value**;**  <br>hm**.**put**(**key**,** count**);**  <br>**}** **else** **{**  <br>hm**.**put**(**key**,** value**);**  <br>**}**  <br>**}**  <br>**}**  <br>**}**  <br>**return** hm**;**  <br>**}**|